{"fact": "0.5", "status": "stated", "evidence": [{"item": 10, "quote": "Since smaller - appearing objects seem farther away than they actually are ,"}]},
{"fact": "0.6", "status": "stated", "evidence": [{"item": 10, "quote": "a driver might make a maneuver such as a lane change assuming an adjacent vehicle is a safe distance behind , when in fact it is quite a bit closer ."}]},
